  "title": "Futu Wins Eight Awards at the HKEX Awards, Solidifying Its Lead in Retail Brokerage and the Derivatives Market",
  "summary": "(Hong Kong – March 27, 2026) Futu Securities International (Hong Kong) Limited (“Futu”), a leading fintech company rooted in Hong Kong with a global footprint, is pleased to announce that it has received eight awards at the “HKEX Awards”, marking the seventh consecutive year it has been recognized by Hong Kong Exchanges and Clearing Limited (“HKEX”), underscoring its continued commitment to financial innovation and service excellence.",
